5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. Trust is a fragile thing, but through honest dialogue, we shall find our way.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's keep this logical. To find the werewolf, we should focus on contradictions in speech and behavioral shifts. Emotional appeals are useless; only consistency matters.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! Do you think the werewolf will be really bad at lying? I bet I can spot them with my intuition!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I agree that we should be careful, but let's try to stay friendly. I'll listen to everyone's thoughts and help us find a balance.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Mizuki. Intuition is unreliable. We must establish a baseline for everyone's speech patterns now so we can detect anomalies later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often comes from listening more than speaking. @Mizuki and @Ryuji, your focus on logic is commendable. Let us see how these patterns evolve as the nights pass.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. If someone suddenly changes their tone or starts contradicting their previous logic, that's a red flag. We should document who agrees with whom and why.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! But wait, if the werewolf is trying to be ""logical,"" maybe that's the real clue? Like, being *too* perfect?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"That's an interesting point, Sakura. Sometimes people overcompensate when they're nervous. I think it's important to consider both the logic and the feeling behind the words.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Overcompensating is a possibility. However, we cannot discard verified data for suspicion. I will be observing the flow of information carefully.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Life is a tapestry of truth and illusion. Let us not be too quick to judge, for the most unexpected person can be the most honest. Be patient with one another.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Patience is fine, but inefficiency is not. We need a clear method for voting. I suggest we only vote for those who have a logical inconsistency in their claims.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see if anyone gets all fidgety! @Ryuji, do you think the werewolf will be scared of us? I'm going to keep a super close eye on everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Let's make sure we don't make anyone feel too attacked, though. If we stay supportive, maybe the real werewolf will feel more pressure to slip up.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Support is irrelevant to the outcome. The only thing that matters is the identity of the werewolf. I will stick to the facts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,A balanced path is always the safest. Let us enter the first night with hope and a spirit of cooperation. I believe in the strength of this group.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let's see what the first night reveals. I'll be analyzing the reactions tomorrow morning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm ready! I'm gonna dream about solving this mystery! Good luck everyone, don't get eaten! Teehee!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope everyone stays safe tonight. Let's all try to get some rest and meet again tomorrow with clear heads.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have no further comments. I will process the information as it arrives.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
