33,1,1,talk,Servas,,The morning sun brings a new perspective. Let us share our thoughts gently. Has anyone noticed anything unusual in the atmosphere this morning?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's get straight to the point. If the Seer found something, they should consider how to reveal it without becoming an immediate target. Who feels the most pressure?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning! I feel like something is different! @Servas, you're being very calm, almost *too* calm! Is that a clue? I'm curious!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I'm just glad we're all still here. Let's take a deep breath and listen to each other before we jump to conclusions.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Servas is human. I have verified this. However, revealing my role too early is a risk. I will observe how the others react to this information.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, my age has taught me that peace is the only way to see the truth clearly. @Ryuji, your transparency is a bold move. It shows great courage.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, claiming to be the Seer is a classic move for both a Seer and a Werewolf. If you are the Seer, who did you check? If you're lying, you've just painted a target on yourself.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa, Ryuji is the Seer?! That's so cool! But wait, Mizuki is right! What if he's a sneaky werewolf pretending to be the Seer? That would be a great prank!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Let's not call it a prank, Sakura. @Ryuji, if you are the Seer, we trust you, but please be careful. I want to make sure we don't accidentally hurt a villager.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I checked Servas. He is human. Whether you believe me or not is irrelevant; the fact remains. I will not repeat myself.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is heartening to see such a spirited debate. Let us remember that we are all on the same side of wanting the truth to prevail.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji's claim is efficient, but it's too convenient. If he's the werewolf, he's already secured Servas as an ally in the eyes of the village. It's a strategic play.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, Mizuki is making me think! @Midori, you're being very quiet and nice. Are you hiding something? You're like a mysterious cat!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Oh! I'm just trying to make sure everyone feels heard. I don't have any special information, I'm just a villager hoping we can all get along.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,Mizuki's suspicion is based on a hypothetical scenario. My statement is based on a result. I prefer the latter.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"When the wind blows, the trees bend. Let us not let suspicion bend our spirits. I trust in the process we have established.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I've noticed that Sakura is deflecting by making jokes and Midori is playing the peacemaker. Both are common masks. However, Ryuji's claim is the most volatile element here.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm not deflecting! I'm just being me! But I think Mizuki is being a bit too mean. Maybe the werewolf is just grumpy!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I think we should trust Ryuji for now, but keep our eyes open. If we execute a villager today, we lose a lot of strength. Let's be cautious.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have provided the data. The decision now rests on your ability to reason. I will vote based on who is most likely to be the werewolf.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
