66,2,1,talk,Servas,,A tragedy has befallen us. Midori was a gentle soul. Let us honor her memory by finding the truth with even greater resolve.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Midori's execution was a result of the group's uncertainty. Now that she's gone, the pool of suspects is smaller. Ryuji, you're still here. Any new findings?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Midori is gone! This is getting scary! And Ryuji was attacked! That means the werewolf really wants him dead! He must be the Seer!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Servas,,"The darkness often strikes those who bring the light. @Ryuji, you have endured a great trial. Please, tell us what you have seen.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,Being attacked doesn't prove he's the Seer; it only proves he was a threat to the werewolf. It could be a play to gain trust. Let's look at the votes.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, stop being so suspicious of everything! Ryuji is hurt! He's definitely a good guy! I bet the werewolf is someone who's trying to confuse us!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Servas,,"In the silence of loss, the truth often whispers. Let us listen to the evidence and the intuition of our hearts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Sakura, your ""intuition"" is just emotional reaction. Look at the logic: if Ryuji is the Seer, he knows who is human. If he's the werewolf, he's playing a very dangerous game.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"I don't care about ""logic"" if it means being mean! I think Mizuki is the werewolf because she's trying to make everyone doubt Ryuji!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us not let anger cloud our vision. We must decide who to trust before the night falls again. I believe we should trust the one who has been targeted.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Trusting the target is a gamble. However, if we execute the wrong person now, the werewolf wins. I'll consider the options, but Sakura's bias is showing.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not biased, I'm just right! Ryuji is the Seer, and Mizuki is being super suspicious! Let's get the werewolf!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
